range synth1 pitch -17.179 1.821 sounds good from C1 to G2 (key -12 .. +7)
range synth1 drive 0 0.05 how aggressive the boiling sounds
range synth1 reverb 0 1 radiating power at 1, small and contained at 0
range synth1 phaser 0 1 subtle; the phaser rate adds a rhythmic element
range synth1 ph_stages 3 5
range synth3 pitch -20.033 3.967 key -12 .. +12; avoid gather (harsh); reverb and flange are the power and rhythm knobs
range synth3 reverb 0 1 power
range synth3 flange 0 1 rhythm
range synth8 pitch -12.416 11.584 key -12 (C2) .. +12 (C4); harsh above +7, like something is about to pop
range synth8 gather 0 1 takes chords well at 1
range synth8 reverb 0 1
range synth8 phaser 0 1 avoid touching drive
range tones pitch -9 27
bind orb.radius synth3 level 0 1
bind stir synth1 level 0.6 0
bind orb.speed tones level 0 0.4
bind drive tones pitch -9 12
note Hand-off set. At rest only synth1 plays (the rumble bed). An arm's layer fades in with that arm's reach and sits on
note the arm's pitch. coherence swaps the bed's character: boiling and dry while detuned, calm and radiating when caught,
note and it steps back so the arm layers carry the sound. The crank's spin (drive) is heard as the bed's phaser.
note cloud is silent unless the motions are consonant; radiance (Z reach, tiers II-III) opens the reverbs; score brings fire
note up as the near-miss flicker, and the signature takes over past 0.55. tension and lava are unbound: spares to try.
note Rule of thumb: one absolute bind per param (two add their deltas and surprise you); use rel binds for offsets.
